{%- comment -%}
  Above-the-fold star rating + count, from Judge.me.
  Renders empty until reviews are attached to THIS product in Judge.me (ticket T8) —
  store-wide reviews do not populate a per-product badge. Judge.me's script is loaded
  by its app embed, so no extra script is needed here.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="pd-rating">
  <div class="jdgm-widget jdgm-preview-badge" data-id="{{ product.id }}"></div>
</div>
